  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Crlp/4749/2021 on 6 January, 2022 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition Nos. 1440 of 2020, 3708, 3866, 4494, 4698 and 4749 of 2021 Order:",
    "facts": "Insofar as the IPC, COTP Act, FSS Act offences are concerned, these are covered matters in view of the earlier common orders passed by this Court in Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch and Criminal Petition No.2966 of 2021 and batch, whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several F.I.Rs registered for the similar offences based on identical facts. However, as regards the other offences punishable under the A.P. Excise Act and the NDPS Act, they CRLP/4749/2021 on 6 January, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/105922798/ 1 are not covered by the aforesaid common orders of this Court.",
